<view class="page workbench {{careMode ? 'care-mode' : ''}}">
  <view class="wb-head">
    <view class="wb-kicker">管理端</view>
    <view class="wb-title">社区服务工作台</view>
    <view class="wb-user" wx:if="{{profile}}">{{profile.displayName}} · {{roleLabel}}</view>
    <view class="wb-loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在校验登录态…</view>
  </view>

  <view class="wb-grid">
    <view wx:for="{{cards}}" wx:key="k" class="wb-card">
      <view class="wb-card__n">{{item.n}}</view>
      <view class="wb-card__t">{{item.t}}</view>
      <view class="wb-card__d">{{item.d}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="wb-sec">
    <view class="wb-sec__h">
      <text>最近工单</text>
      <text class="wb-sec__n">{{total}} 条</text>
    </view>
    <view class="wb-empty" wx:if="{{loadingList}}">正在加载工单…</view>
    <view class="wb-empty" wx:elif="{{loadError}}">{{loadError}}</view>
    <view class="wb-empty" wx:elif="{{!list.length}}">还没有工单。居民提交报修后，会实时出现在这里。</view>
    <view wx:else class="wb-list">
      <view
        class="wb-item"
        wx:for="{{list}}"
        wx:key="_id"
        data-index="{{index}}"
        bindtap="onItem"
        hover-class="wb-item--hover"
      >
        <view class="wb-item__top">
          <text class="wb-item__t">{{item.title}}</text>
          <text class="wb-item__s">{{item.statusLabel}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="wb-item__d">{{item.aiSummary || item.description}}</view>
        <view class="wb-item__m">{{item.createdAtText}} · {{item.categoryLabel}} · 居民报修</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="wb-note">
    工单数据来自云数据库 workorders 集合；居民端新提交的报修会按状态实时统计在这里。
    放单、验收、最终确认等流转操作将在下一实施步骤接入。
  </view>

  <view class="wb-actions">
    <view class="wb-action" bindtap="onBackResident">返回居民端</view>
    <view class="wb-action wb-action--danger" bindtap="onLogout">退出工作人员账号</view>
  </view>
</view>
